BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:beaujolais-nouveau-day-20261119@todaycelebrates.com
DTSTAMP:20261014T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261120
SUMMARY:Beaujolais Nouveau Day
DESCRIPTION:Beaujolais Nouveau Day is the single date on which the year's B
 eaujolais Nouveau may go on sale — a young red wine bottled weeks after 
 the harvest\, released on the third Thursday of November\, which in 2026 i
 s November 19. The date is a rule rather than a marketing choice: Inter Be
 aujolais\, the region's trade body\, traces it to a French decree of 1985.
  In 2022\, 16.5 million bottles of Beaujolais and Beaujolais Villages Nouv
 eaux were sold\, 6.5 million of them exported to more than 100 countries.\
 n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/beaujolais-nouveau-day/
URL;VALUE=URI:https://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/beaujolais-nouveau-day/
CATEGORIES:Beer
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
